HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1513, "an `extern` names the header its signatures come from \342\200\224 `extern \"math.h\"`, then the signatures indented under it. Without the header there is no `#include`, and nothing checks the declaration (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1514, "expected_extern_header");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1515, "set `LIBRARY_PATH` to the directory holding it, or name a `package` and let `pkg-config` answer; `link` takes the library's **name**, as `link \"sqlite3\"`");
